{"ref":"BDB, אַלָּה","hw":"אַלָּה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַלָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. oak (</strong>cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אַלּוֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_אַלּוֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">אַלּוֹן</a>, but 𝔊 here τερέμινθος<strong>)</strong> only <a data-ref=\"Joshua 24:26\" href=\"/Joshua.24.26\">Jos 24:26</a> <em>the oak which is in the sanctuary of</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>; read however perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵלָה</span>, <em>terebinth</em> (v. i. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֵלָה\" href=\"/BDB,_אֵלָה\", dir=\"rtl\">אֵלָה</a>).","next":"BDB, אַלּוֹן","prev":"BDB, אלל²"}